# Use English in this project

Write all project artifacts in English:

- Source comments, Kconfig help text, overlay notes, and docs
- Identifiers, log strings, and commit messages
- Do not add Chinese (or other non-English) comments or user-facing strings in code

Chat replies to the user may still follow the user's language preference.
